&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CNC PROGRAMMER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Auckland, this is your opportunity to take a leading role in Rocket Lab’s Fabrication and Machining team, shaping the future of space exploration! As a senior expert in manual and CNC machining, you’ll be hands-on in creating precision aerospace components for launch vehicles, Space Systems, and cutting-edge R&amp;amp;D projects. From programming and operating CNC machines to crafting high-tolerance parts, your work will drive prototype development and flight-critical hardware production, all while ensuring the highest standards of quality and reliability. Join a driven team that’s tackling challenging projects, delivering on exciting missions, and making an impact on the future of space!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET TO DO: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day machining of parts according to drawing specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and maintain machinery, tooling and equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, simulate, and execute toolpath NC files using NX CAM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and create holding fixtures as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform visual quality checks and measurements using GD&amp;amp;T standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain inventory of spares and consumables for efficient reordering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU’LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trade qualified in relevant industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in CNC machining and CAM programming (ideally NX CAM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of GD&amp;amp;T and measurement instruments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-sufficient in low-run job-shop machining and precision mechanical assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working to exacting standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer literacy and familiarity with smartphones/tablets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-axis machining experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a team environment and autonomously.&lt;/li&gt;
