&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work within&amp;nbsp;a small team dedicated to designing, operating, and maintaining the&amp;nbsp;avionic test&amp;nbsp;systems to&amp;nbsp;support all of Rocket Lab’s&amp;nbsp;mission from&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;floor&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;launch operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
