&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in mechanical engineering, manufacturing engineering, aerospace engineering, or other engineering discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing and introducing fabrication methods such as OTW, TIG, proof testing and cleaning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting up and operating a tube shop or build area&lt;/li&gt;
