&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Manufacturing&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;Intern&amp;nbsp;based at Rocket Lab’s site in&amp;nbsp;Long Beach, California,&amp;nbsp;you will have&amp;nbsp;the opportunity to&amp;nbsp;work with the design,&amp;nbsp;production&amp;nbsp;and quality teams to develop and qualify process to make rocket engines. Rocket Lab’s Manufacturing team are the builders and the doers who work with our advanced machinery across our global manufacturing sites to get our satellites, satellite components, and rockets out the door.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
