&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;Climb ladders and work at elevated height&amp;nbsp;small&amp;nbsp;spaces, awkward positions, and tight areas as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
