&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Successful candidates in this role will thrive in ambiguity, and are excited to work in a small, high performing team focused on continued learning and growth. This position is ideal for an experienced, multidisciplinary engineer keen to support a complex project from conceptual design through to integration and launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU&#39;LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
