&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Production Supervisor will build, train, manage and retain a team of technicians from broad disciplines that may include vehicle integration, mechanical assembly, or composite lamination. As a supervisor, you must be an inspiring leader and set standards for the team but also be ready to work with your hands and contribute directly to our production objectives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
