&lt;li&gt;LN data dictionary and table structures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LN session customization and development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Custom program&amp;nbsp;script development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infor ION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LN web services (SOAP, REST APIs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with geographically distributed teams across multiple time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with occasional outside business hours meetings during key project phases &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
