&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in space system network architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of 5G NTN core integration, backhaul and D2D connectivity design, and/or edge computing for CU/DU functional split&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience in using scripting language in a relevant context (Python, C#, C++)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a variety of customers including commercial, civil, and military in developing mission solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;U.S citizenship required due to program requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU&#39;LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS AS A SENIOR NETWORK DESIGN ENGINEER II:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
