&lt;p&gt;Ready to make your mark? We&#39;re hunting for a dynamic IT Project Manager in Auckland, New Zealand to spearhead our game-changing Payroll implementation across the region!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just another contract, it&#39;s your chance to drive real transformation in a high-impact, &lt;strong&gt;12-month fixed-term role &lt;/strong&gt;where you&#39;ll be at the center of the action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picture yourself leading from the front, orchestrating the complete end-to-end delivery of our strategic payroll program, plus exciting enterprise initiatives that will shape our digital landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be the catalyst for change, bringing together cross-functional teams, energizing stakeholders, and turning ambitious plans into impressive reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL GET TO DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Implement our new payroll system (ADP) to streamline processes and improve payroll accuracy&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop project charters, timelines, resource plans, and risk assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver projects on time, on scope, and on budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional teams to execute plans and achieve objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor progress, identify risks, and implement corrective actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal resources and manage external vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain stakeholder alignment and executive communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage scope changes using verification techniques and change control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance using PM tools (Smartsheet, MS Project, Confluence, JIRA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report status regularly and escalate issues appropriately&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive risk management and maintain RAID logs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU&#39;LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of proven project management experience, including large‑scale enterprise system implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience &lt;strong&gt;leading ADP or payroll implementations or rollouts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and organizational change management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience (12+ years of related professional experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to manage cross‑functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem‑solving skills to address project challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast‑paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP or similar project management certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in aerospace, defense, or high‑tech manufacturing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise project/program management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in multiple project management methodologies (Waterfall, Agile, hybrid approaches)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position may require prolonged periods of sitting, standing, walking, computer work, and occasional exposure to moderate levels of noise, dust, and fumes in production areas.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the above sounds like you&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;apply&lt;/strong&gt; now!&lt;/p&gt;
