&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Radar systems (MTI, SAR, change detection)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5G Non-Terrestrial Networks (NTN), broadband, and tactical communications systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passive RF sensing and signals intelligence&lt;/li&gt;
