&lt;li&gt;5+ years of engineering experience in the aerospace industry; with 2+ years directly supporting development projects and 1+ years in project or team leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong knowledge of how to interpret organizational, software, and hardware technical documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience in systems engineering, with a strong focus on developing, testing, and integrating with space or airborne instruments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with requirements management and modeling tools such as JAMA, Doors, or Cameo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting development programs&lt;/li&gt;
